      "type": "FACILITATION_TIP",
      "content": "<b>Debrief Reminder:</b> Debrief the overall experience. <ul>\n<li> Use the <b><i>Snapshot</b></i> tab in the Debrief tool to show what happened next. If any teams earned \"Cold as Ice\" (the best outcome) or \"Cool and Collected,\" ask how they achieved that.\n<li> Use the slides to explore the steps of building an influence strategy in more detail.\n<li> Reconnect with the initial framing of this session: the importance of the strategic aspect of influence (not just the tactical).\n<li> Finally, use <b><i>Reflections</b></i> to ask any reflection questions that strike you as valuable for your cohort.",
